Open the camera's album in the gallery

A thumbnail tap asks Xiaomi's gallery for its review action and, without it, falls back to
ACTION_VIEW, which shows the one item. MediaStore.ACTION_REVIEW opens the item within its album.

--- a/com/android/camera/Camera.smali
+++ b/com/android/camera/Camera.smali
@@ -15992,7 +15992,7 @@
     :try_start_1bf
     new-instance p0, Landroid/content/Intent;
 
-    const-string p1, "android.intent.action.VIEW"
+    const-string p1, "android.provider.action.REVIEW"
 
     invoke-direct {p0, p1, v7}, Landroid/content/Intent;-><init>(Ljava/lang/String;Landroid/net/Uri;)V
 
